hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1144","Yunus bin Abdul-Ala told us, Ibn Wahb told us, Amr bin Al-Harith told me, that Abu Suwayya told him, that he heard Ibn Hujayra narrates, on the authority of Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas: On the authority of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, that he said: “Whoever performs ten verses will not He will be recorded as one of the heedless, and whoever recites a hundred verses will be written as one of the obedient, and whoever recites a thousand verses will be written as one of the humble.”"
